        "original_id": "2ed508f1-04c4-519e-b800-c8b2842b194d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Australian Women's Weekly, Godey's Lady's Book, Fresh with the Australian Women's Weekly\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- People: Lyndey Milan\n- Places: Sydney, Philadelphia\n- Topics: women's magazines\n\nFacts:\n- Godey's Lady's Book was a United States women's magazine published in Philadelphia from 1830 to 1878.\n- The Australian Women's Weekly is an Australian monthly women's magazine published by Bauer Media Group in Sydney.\n- Lyndey Milan was the Food Director for The Australian Women's Weekly.\n- Lyndey Milan was a co-host of the Channel 9 show Fresh with the Australian Women's Weekly.",
